<title>UK: World natural rubber stocks rose in Nov--IRSG.</title>
<headline>World natural rubber stocks rose in Nov--IRSG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>World stocks of natural rubber rose in November 1996, by 10,000 tonnes but stocks of synthetic rubber fell by 30,000 tonnes, according to the International Rubber Study Group.</p>
<p>   Data in thousand tonnes -- NOV'96    OCT'96    NOV'95</p>
<p>Natural production		  550	 560	 510</p>
<p>Natural consumption		 540	 580	 510</p>
<p>Natural stocks		    1,670     1,660     1,620</p>
<p>Synthetic production		810	 820	 770</p>
<p>Synthetic consumption	     840	 840	 790</p>
<p>Synthetic stocks		  2,350     2,380     2,300</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 4985</p>
